				{
					"id": 206010701,
					"content": "你回来了，杰克也回来了，但是一瘸一拐的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						206010702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "塞琉斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 206010702,
					"content": "到底发生什么了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						206010703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "塞琉斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 206010703,
					"content": "杰克因为冒进受伤了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						206010704
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 206010704,
					"content": "果然和我想的一样，唉…平时我和他说的话，他都没怎么记得。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						206010705
					],
					"speakerTitle": "塞琉斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 206010705,
					"content": "虽然我也理解他想要证明自己的心思，但是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						206010706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "塞琉斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 206010706,
					"content": "算了，这件事我已经了解了，杰克那边我会去和他谈谈。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						206010707
					],
					"speakerTitle": "塞琉斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 206010707,
					"content": "这是给你的，算是你冒险的奖励吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "塞琉斯"
